ce":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.hFtNbo1LKYCoDy2O","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"wpUevDT5nPDNwNIt","name":"Scythe","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["deadly-d10","magical","reach-10","trip"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"ue7s3l4qoy88pbeonv84":{"damage":"2d10+10","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":20},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"BtY17pouV1vKvpve","name":"Fist","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","reach-10"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"fy8vwq54if8h7vscd7er":{"damage":"2d8+9","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":20},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"PsiFbnqgdXdtvqcQ","name":"Necromantic Blow","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The runes on the slaugh's body glow white with unholy power as the slaugh channels its constituent souls' strength into a single powerful blow. The slaugh makes a fist Strike against a creature within range. On a hit, the creature must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:26|name:Necromantic Blow|traits:damagaing-effect,divine, incapacitation, necromancy, negative|showDC:gm]{Fortitude} save; regardless of the result, the creature still takes the usual damage from the slaugh's fist Strike.</p>\n<p>The slaugh is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} until its next turn<span>, and it can't use Necromantic Blow again for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}</span>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes [[/r 2d6[void]]] damage and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes [[/r 4d6[void]]] damage and is enfeebled 1 for [[/r 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes [[/r 8d6[void]]] damage, is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 2}, and is enfeebled 1 for 1 minute.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","incapacitation"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"8MHpWnldqWSbZrsh","name":"Reap","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round;</p>\n\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The slaugh swings its scythe at one foe, then deftly twists the weapon's handle to knock a different opponent off balance. The slaugh Strikes one creature in range, then Trips a separate foe in range. Both actions count toward the slaugh's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after both actions are completed.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"hkmzY27yw9FtLXdu","name":"Tyrant's Command","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/ThreeActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The slaugh exerts its incredible will to command up to 4 mindless undead creatures within 60 feet to plunge into battle. Each affected undead creature can Stride or Strike without spending an action. This ability can affect only mindless undead whose level is 3 or lower.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","divine","linguistic"],"rarity":"common"},"publication"